# Changes from draft-melnikov-email-big-files-00 {#changes}
{:numbered="false"}

* Renamed "Content-External" to "Content-Link-Attachment", with
  Content-Disposition syntax, and allowed it in the header section of
  the message too.
* Added "cid", the HTML markup, and "cid" URLs that refer to linked
  attachments.
* Added "key", for encrypted files, and "stored-digest-\*".
* Made "size" and "digest-sha-256" required.
* Renamed "name" to "filename", and replaced the media type with
  "type".
* Added "description" and the Content-Disposition date parameters.
* Removed "permission": a linked attachment can't change.
* Added requirements for attachment servers, receiving servers and
  message stores.
* Wrote the Security and Privacy Considerations.

